=== iterative solvers: the predicate as a loop condition ===
every loop runs until `report of change` is settled and HOLDs — the observer,
not a magnitude tolerance, decides when to stop. (iters include the hold)

Jacobi        Ax=b -> <buffer:3>
              27 iters
Gauss-Seidel  Ax=b -> <buffer:3>
              21 iters  (fresh values -> fewer than Jacobi)

Power iteration dominant eigenvalue -> 2  (14 iters, expect ~2)

PageRank stationary distribution -> <buffer:3>  (44 iters)

